    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the list. one more thing—sometimes i feel like my blood sugar is fine, but then i get these sudden, weird energy crashes that feel almost out of nowhere. is there a way to tell if that's actually a glucose issue or if something else is going on?",
